window.MineCGSPageTranslations={"它是一份进服安装包，包含进入 MineCGS 服务器需要的模组、配置和服务器链接。启动器会按包里的清单下载并安装所需文件。":"It is a setup package containing the mods, settings and server address needed to join MineCGS. Your launcher uses its file list to download and install everything.","不用解压，也不用自己逐个装模组。把 .mrpack 文件拖进支持它的 HMCL、PCL2 等启动器，就能开始安装。":"Do not unzip it or install the mods one by one. Drag the .mrpack file into a compatible launcher, such as HMCL or PCL2, to begin installation.","本教程面向 Windows / macOS 电脑上的 Minecraft Java 版；手机和 iPad 不能按这套步骤安装。已有启动器？直接看第 04 步。":"This guide is for Minecraft Java Edition on Windows / macOS computers. These steps do not work on phones or iPads. Already have a launcher? Skip to step 04.","mrpack 是什么？":"What is an mrpack?","启动器就是用来安装和打开 Minecraft 的工具。第一次使用，推荐先用 HMCL。":"A launcher installs and opens Minecraft. For your first setup, we recommend HMCL.","HMCL 官网":"HMCL official website","打开官方下载页":"Official downloads","打开下载页，选择“稳定版”，再选择与你电脑对应的 Windows 或 Mac 下载项。":"Open the download page, choose the stable release, then select the Windows or Mac download for your computer.","Windows 用户下载 .exe 文件。新建一个容易找到的文件夹（例如 MineCGS），把启动器放进去，再双击打开。":"On Windows, download the .exe file. Create an easy-to-find folder, such as MineCGS, put the launcher in it, then double-click it.","Mac 用户选择 Mac 下载项，按下载说明打开。启动器提示缺少 Java 时，继续下一步。":"On Mac, choose the Mac download and follow its opening instructions. If the launcher says Java is missing, continue to the next step.","下载 HMCL":"Get HMCL","Java 是运行 Minecraft 的基础环境。本进服包使用 Java 25；它和启动器是两个不同的东西。":"Java is the runtime Minecraft needs. This pack uses Java 25; Java and the launcher are separate tools.","下载 Zulu JRE 25":"Download Zulu JRE 25","在下载页选择 Java 25 (LTS)、你的系统，以及 JRE。大多数 Windows 电脑选择 x86 64-bit；Windows ARM 电脑选择 ARM 64-bit。":"Select Java 25 (LTS), your operating system and JRE. Most Windows PCs use x86 64-bit; Windows ARM PCs use ARM 64-bit.","Windows 优先下载 .msi，双击后按提示完成安装，再重新打开 HMCL。":"On Windows, choose .msi when available, double-click it and complete the installer, then reopen HMCL.","Mac 的 Apple 芯片（M 系列）选 ARM 64-bit，Intel 芯片选 x86 64-bit。若下载的是 .zip，解压到固定文件夹。":"On Mac, Apple silicon (M-series) uses ARM 64-bit; Intel uses x86 64-bit. If you download a .zip, extract it into a permanent folder.","如果启动器没有自动找到 Java，在该版本的设置中选择 Java 25；需要手动指定时，找到安装目录里的 bin/javaw.exe（Windows）或 bin/java（Mac）。":"If the launcher does not detect Java, select Java 25 in the installed instance settings. To choose it manually, locate bin/javaw.exe (Windows) or bin/java (Mac) in the Java installation folder.","某些系统只提供 JDK 25，也可以使用。Mac 的 Java 可能位于解压文件夹中的 Contents/Home/bin。":"If your platform only offers JDK 25, it works too. On Mac, the Java executable may be under Contents/Home/bin inside the extracted folder.","安装 Java 25":"Install Java 25","回官网点击“下载进服包”，阅读须知并确认，保存 minecgs-modpack.mrpack。":"On the homepage, choose Download modpack, read and confirm the notice, then save minecgs-modpack.mrpack.","打开 HMCL，把这个文件从文件夹拖到启动器主界面。使用 PCL2 时，也可尝试拖入主界面；请使用支持 mrpack 的新版。":"Open HMCL and drag the file from its folder onto the launcher home screen. With PCL2, try dragging it onto the home screen too; use a recent version with mrpack support.","出现安装窗口后，给它取一个名称（例如 MineCGS），点击安装，等待下载完成。":"When the import window appears, give the instance a name, such as MineCGS, choose Install and wait for the downloads to finish.","如果拖动没有反应，在启动器里找“导入整合包”或“安装整合包”，手动选择这个 .mrpack 文件。":"If dragging does nothing, look for Import modpack or Install modpack in the launcher and select the .mrpack file manually.","返回官网下载进服包":"Return home to download the pack","导入进服包":"Import the pack","在启动器中登录你的 Minecraft 账号，选中刚安装的 MineCGS 版本，再点击启动。":"Sign in to your Minecraft account in the launcher, select the MineCGS instance you installed, then launch it.","进入主界面后打开多人服务器列表，找到进服包预置的 MineCGS 服务器，点击连接。":"Open the multiplayer server list, find the preconfigured MineCGS server and connect.","如果列表为空、连接失败或提示没有权限，把提示截图发给我们。":"If the list is empty, the connection fails or access is denied, send us a screenshot of the message.","联系项目成员":"Contact the team","启动并进入服务器":"Launch and join","提示 Java 不兼容":"Java is incompatible","检查 MineCGS 这个版本是否选中了 Java 25，而不是旧的 Java 8、17 或 21。":"Check that the MineCGS instance uses Java 25, rather than Java 8, 17 or 21.","文件被当成压缩包打开":"The file opens as an archive","关闭解压软件，回到文件所在的文件夹，把文件拖进启动器。不要修改 .mrpack 后缀。":"Close the archive app, return to the folder and drag the file into your launcher. Do not change its .mrpack extension.","下载失败或启动后报错":"Downloads fail or launch errors appear","先检查网络，再重试。仍然失败时，保留启动器的报错或日志，连同截图发给项目成员。":"Check your connection and retry. If it still fails, keep the launcher error or log and send it to the team with a screenshot.","HMCL 官方文档":"HMCL documentation","Zulu 安装说明":"Zulu installation guide","卡住了？":"Need help?","安装指南 · MineCGS":"Installation guide · MineCGS","第一次加入 MineCGS？从下载 HMCL、安装 Java 25 到导入 mrpack，一步一步开始。":"New to MineCGS? A short guide to downloading HMCL, installing Java 25 and importing the mrpack.","安装目录":"Installation contents","从这里开始":"Start here","跳至教程":"Skip to the guide","返回首页":"Back home","第一次加入？":"Your first visit?","下载、拖入、启动。一步一步来。":"Download, import, launch. One step at a time.","联系我们":"Contact us"};
